I've been working on my first Monk ascension, and I had a promising
one going. useful equipment I had found included /oPoly,
=oPolyControl, a whole bunch of potions I had alchemized to full
healing and boosted hp, had a !oGainLevel to save for later, started
with magic marker, had found a pair of iron shoes at +5(!) and an iron
helm at +1, mine's end was the wine cellar, so a bunch of potions,
minetown altar was co-aligned, so easy access to holy water. Blessed a
touchstone, hello tons of cash and protection. Had learned force bolt
to train attack spells. Nothing amazing, but promising.

Then, stupidity and disaster struck. First, I had at some point gotten
