trusting to my memory of inventory letters, I went to re-wear the robe
and accidentally put on an unidentified helm, which turned out to be
opposite alignment. goodbye protection, not to mention 3 ac from the
helm switch. Out of holy water, couldn't pray at the now cross-aligned
altar to make more. Read a scroll I thought I had price-id'd as remove
curse, was destroy armor. Goodbye robe (of course it couldn't take the
damn helm instead; although I didn't want to lose it for possible
ascension kit, I wasn't too concerned with that). Did have a blank
scroll and magic marker though, so I went ahead and dusted the helm
